<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Website strategy &amp; structure</h3><p>Before any design, we agree what the website must do: who it is for, what they need to find, and what action they should take. The sitemap and page structure follow from those answers.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Responsive website design</h3><p>A design that adapts to phones, tablets and desktops without losing its character. Your brand’s look and feel carry through every page, so the site feels like your business — not a template.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Website development</h3><p>Clean, reliable builds that load quickly and are easy to update. We build marketing websites and landing pages, and our <a href="/software/">software studio</a> handles larger custom applications when a project needs one.</p></div>
<div class="deliverable reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Enquiry journeys &amp; landing pages</h3><p>Forms, calls to action and landing pages designed around one job: turning a visit into an enquiry. Every page has a clear next step, and nothing stands between the visitor and it.</p></div>
<p class="caption">Your project scope, deliverables and timeline are agreed after our first conversation.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WHO IT’S FOR</span><h2>Who this service is for</h2><p>A website is often the first meeting a customer has with your business. We build sites for companies that need that meeting to go well — whether the goal is enquiries, bookings, admissions or sales.</p></div>
<div class="values">
<article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Real estate</h3><p>Project pages, galleries and enquiry forms that help buyers shortlist a property before they call.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>E-commerce</h3><p>Product-led sites that make it easy to browse, compare and buy — on a phone as much as on a desktop.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Healthcare</h3><p>Clear, reassuring websites for clinics and hospitals, with services, doctors and appointments easy to find.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Education</h3><p>Course pages, admission information and enquiry journeys for schools, colleges and training institutes.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>B2B &amp; industrial</h3><p>Websites that explain complex products simply and give serious buyers a reason to get in touch.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>06</span><h3>FMCG &amp; retail</h3><p>Brand and store websites that show the range, tell the story and point people to where they can buy.</p></article>
