<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">HOW WE WORK</span><h2>Through our five-step process</h2><p>Every website follows the same five-step process — Discover, Plan, Build, Launch, Grow — so design, content and development stay in step from the first meeting to long after launch.</p></div>
<div class="values">
<article class="reveal"><span>01</span><h3>Discover</h3><p>We study your business, your customers and your current website, and agree what success looks like.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>02</span><h3>Plan</h3><p>Structure, content and design direction are agreed before building starts, so there are no surprises later.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>Design and development move together, with your content — written in-house or by our <a href="/copyright/">copywriting team</a> — fitted to every page.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>04</span><h3>Launch</h3><p>Testing across devices and browsers, then a careful launch, with <a href="/expertise-seo/">on-page SEO</a> in place from day one.</p></article>
<article class="reveal"><span>05</span><h3>Grow</h3><p>After launch, we review how visitors use the site and keep improving the pages that matter most.</p></article>
</div></section>
